/E (      Upon successful login in, users are directed to the Dried Fish IoT Monitoring Dashboard, where the system interface displays the navigation menu \(Dashboard, Sensor Data, Start Drying, About, and Logout\), the real-time system header showing connection status, total logs, and the count of active and completed drying jobs, as well as a table containing the drying job details such as fish type, temperature, humidity, start and end time, status, and available actions. )
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [4 5]
>>
endobj
