<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (     Both Admin and Staff accounts share the same interface and menu layout; however, the Staff dashboard shows only the Active Drying and Completed Drying sections, while the Admin dashboard displays the full overview of all system logs, historical data, and overall drying activities . this differences made to ensures that the staff members can perform their operational duties while administrators retain full oversight of the entire system.)
/Pg 23 0 R
>>
endobj
